^show (info|stat)\n$
^show servers (state|conn)( be_app)?\n$
^set server be_app/[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,32} state (ready|drain|maint)\n$
^set server be_app/[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,32} weight [0-9]{1,3}%?\n$
^set server be_app/(warm_bk|warm_act|iwarm_bk|iwarm_act|elastic-(do|linode)-[1-5]) addr [0-9]{1,3}(\.[0-9]{1,3}){3} port [0-9]{1,5}\n$
